{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚建立了“温暖重新鲜活—更难接受过去无法回来—追问无法改变眼前距离、却又被留恋不断推动”的循环，也指出身体会先于自我追问感到时间的催迫；但它对108–115的骤然激烈、半音阶下行所体现的退却与疲惫，以及努力确认安全反而加重紧张的具体机制，交代得较为含蓄。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版更明确地把92–107转向108–115、半音阶下行的后退感和身体疲惫连成“想留住温暖—用力确认却无法获得安全、反而更加注意到自己的费力—紧张加剧并最终难以维持”的因果链，也分别解释了身体追赶与思绪盘旋；但追问如何因前一次追问无效而再次发生，仍不如甲版说得具体，而且几次快乐与担忧往返的前史有部分超出本段听感能够直接确认的范围。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲版对反复追问的自我续燃机制更凝练，但乙版更清楚地解释了音乐转折、身体先于念头的紧绷，以及试图靠加力留住温暖反而加重不安的反噬机制，因此总体上至少不逊于甲版。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7713f1b9-cbb5-443f-b0e9-59b6f543edd9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140126881378Z", "elapsed_seconds": 142.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:03:49.432527+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "47e06ac8e03c40236dbf554ad70d7fae293a44263025fe2a09243cb92659def5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f6